'''Stone Golems''' are [[Creatures#Aggressive_Creatures|aggressive creatures]] found in the [[Mountain|Mountains]]. They are snow-covered stone humanoids with silver veins visible on their bodies. When disturbed, they awake from their slumber, attacking both the players and other creatures.

