== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Stone Golems|Aggressive creature strategies#Stone golem}}
Stone Golems come in two variants: half of them are equipped with sledges, while the other half have spikes.

Sledge Golems have two attacks.

=== Ground slam ===
Raises one sledge arm up, before slamming it down into the ground (110 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 100 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 100 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). The attack extends 8 meters outward in a 70-degree vertical arc. It has an 8-second cooldown.

=== Double smash ===
Raises both sledge arms up, holds for a moment, and slams them both into the ground (110 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 100 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 100 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). The attack extends 8.66 meters outward in a 70-degree vertical arc. It has a 15-second cooldown.

Spiked Golems have two attacks.

=== Spike ===
Leans back before thrusting at the player in a 7-meter-long attack with no arc (110 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]], 100 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 100 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). This attack can be used every 8 seconds when within 6 meters of a player.

=== Spike sweep ===
Draws its spike back before slashing it in a 7.71-meter 104.24-degree horizontal arc (110 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 100 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 100 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). This can be used every 15 seconds when within 6 meters of a player.

